From c526bb006f646233235030fafce9084cf293b28f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 21:13:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ai): provider HTTP clients, keychain keys and
 offline-only mode

camcraft_app::ai: endpoint laws (offline-only reaches loopback alone,
no plain http off the machine, resolver re-check, no redirects, no env
proxy), wire formats for Anthropic Messages, OpenAI Chat/Responses and
Gemini generateContent, Ollama /api/show capability probe, API keys from
env or the OS keychain only (opaque ApiKey). prefs.json gains
aiOfflineOnly and holds no key. The AI Chat dock uses the live
transport natively; the browser build links no sockets.

New crates (native only): ureq 2.12 (rustls/ring/webpki-roots), keyring 4.2.

Fixes #1945

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
